WEBVTT

00:22:58.236 --> 00:23:00.196
in Afghanistan, in Bangladesh.

00:23:00.196 --> 00:23:01.956
It's going to go way up.

00:23:01.996 --> 00:23:05.436
And you know,
it's horrible to think about,

00:23:05.476 --> 00:23:08.676
but the massive impact
of this Russia crisis

00:23:08.676 --> 00:23:11.156
is going to be much more
global inequality.

00:23:11.156 --> 00:23:12.596
And this is, of course,

00:23:12.636 --> 00:23:16.196
a direct consequence of the end
of the peace dividend more structurally.

00:23:16.236 --> 00:23:19.196
That over the last 30 years
of globalization,

00:23:19.236 --> 00:23:20.396
what did you have?

00:23:20.436 --> 00:23:22.036
A lot of people were left behind,

00:23:22.036 --> 00:23:23.636
but the biggest thing you had

00:23:23.676 --> 00:23:28.476
was the explosion of a single
global middle class.

00:23:28.996 --> 00:23:30.676
On the back of the pandemic